<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sells no further OLOs.</title>
<headline>Belgium sells no further OLOs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said on Tuesday it sold no further linear bonds (OLO) at its non-competitive OLO auction.</p>
<p>The Treasury allotted 14.040 billion francs worth of March 2007 OLOs and 14.025 billion francs of March 2001 OLOs at its auction on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
